  "notes": [
    "Figures and seven aggregate source files are exact copies of the approved final assets; the exact-statistics CSV is a metric-scoped subset with every retained value unchanged. This synchronization did not rerun model inference or statistical analysis.",
    "The public table filenames are retained for backward compatibility; manuscript table numbers are stated separately.",
    "Earlier non-AUC intervals retain the approved frozen bootstrap estimates; no historical bootstrap AUC summary tables are included.",
    "Exact statistical values are retained in the aggregate sources even where display tables use P < 0.05.",
    "Fig5_I retains the final Patients/Predicted score labels and Positive/Negative legend.",
